{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09270","headline":"经武功旧宅 · 韦应物","name":"经武功旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹邑昔所游，嘉会常在目。\n历载俄二九，始往今来复。\n戚戚居人少，茫茫野田绿。\n风雨经旧墟，毁垣迷往躅。\n门临川流驶，树有羇雌宿。\n多累恒悲往，长年觉时速。\n欲去中复留，徘徊结心曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}